          "overview": "## Outrank MCP Server\n\nThe Outrank MCP server is the official remote server of Outrank, an SEO content platform. It lets AI assistants plan keywords, generate articles and publish them to WordPress, Webflow, Shopify, Framer, Ghost, Notion or a hosted Outrank Blog, rewrite pages that lose traffic, read Google Search Console performance and cannibalization data, and manage internal links and backlinks. It authenticates with OAuth 2.1 (dynamic client registration) and lists the tools the organization's plan includes.",
